<div style="padding: 0.3em; margin: 6px 0; line-height: 150%; font-size: 0.9em;  border: 0; border-width: 0;">Population totale (avant 1962), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiffres_de_population_de_la_France#Aspect_statistique" title="Chiffres de population de la France" class="mw-redirect">sans doubles comptes</a> (1962 à 1990) puis <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiffres_de_population_de_la_France#La_population_municipale" title="Chiffres de population de la France" class="mw-redirect">municipale</a> (1999 et après).
Depuis 1793<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace"> </span>: population sur le territoire communal de l'époque (sensiblement étendu en 1860).<br/>(Sources<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace"> </span>: <i>Des villages de Cassini aux communes d'aujourd'hui</i><sup about="#mwt1786" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-439" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-439"}}'><a href="#cite_note-439" id="mwFNE"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFNI"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNM">[</span>342<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNQ">]</span></span></a></sup>, Insee<sup about="#mwt1789" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-440" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-440"}}'><a href="#cite_note-440" id="mwFNU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFNY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNc">[</span>343<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNg">]</span></span></a></sup><sup class="reference cite_virgule">,</sup><sup about="#mwt1792" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-441" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-441"}}'><a href="#cite_note-441" id="mwFNk"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFNo"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNs">[</span>344<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFNw">]</span></span></a></sup> et voir notes par année.)</div></div>

