<li about="#cite_note-581" id="cite_note-581" data-mw-footnote-number="444"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN5k"><a href="#cite_ref-581" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN5o"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN5s">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-581" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><span class="ouvrage" about="#mwt2382" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwN5w" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Lien web","href":"./Modèle:Lien_web"},"params":{"titre":{"wt":"City of Paris OFFICIAL logo and branding"},"url":{"wt":"https://carrenoir.com/city-of-paris-official-branding"},"site":{"wt":"carrenoir.com"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190722101112/https://carrenoir.com/city-of-paris-official-branding"},"archive-date":{"wt":"2019-07-22"},"brisé le":{"wt":"2026-09-01"},"consulté le":{"wt":"2026-09-01"}},"i":0}}]}'><span class="noarchive" id="mwN50">«<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN54"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20190722101112/https://carrenoir.com/city-of-paris-official-branding" class="external text" id="mwN58"><cite style="font-style:normal;" id="mwN6A">City of Paris OFFICIAL logo and branding</cite></a><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN6E"> </span>» <small class="cachelinks" id="mwN6I"><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwN6M">[</span>archive du <time class="nowrap" datetime="2019-07-22" data-sort-value="2019-07-22" id="mwN6Q">22 juillet 2019</time><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwN6U">]</span></small></span>, sur <span class="italique" id="mwN6Y">carrenoir.com</span> via <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet_Archive" title="Internet Archive" id="mwN6c">Internet Archive</a> <small style="line-height:1em;" id="mwN6g">(consulté le <time class="nowrap" datetime="2026-09-01" data-sort-value="2026-09-01" id="mwN6k"><abbr class="abbr" title="premier" id="mwN6o">1<sup id="mwN6s">er</sup></abbr> septembre 2026</time>)</small></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Catégorie:Article_contenant_un_lien_mort" about="#mwt2382" id="mwN6w"/></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-582" id="cite_note-582" data-mw-footnote-number="445"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN60"><a href="#cite_ref-582" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN64"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN68">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-582" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">«<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN7A"> </span>Emblème national de la Cinquième République, le drapeau tricolore est né de la réunion, sous la Révolution française, des couleurs du roi (blanc) et de la ville de Paris (bleu et rouge).<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN7E"> </span>» Source<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN7I"> </span>: <i id="mwN7M"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.elysee.fr/la-presidence/le-drapeau-francais" class="external text" id="mwN7Q">Le drapeau français</a></i>, sur le site officiel du palais de l’Élysée, siège du président de la République française.</span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-583" id="cite_note-583" data-mw-footnote-number="446"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN7U"><a href="#cite_ref-583" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN7Y"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN7c">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-583" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><span class="ouvrage" id="mwN7g">«<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN7k"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://svowebmaster.free.fr/drapeaux_paris.htm" class="external text" id="mwN7o"><cite style="font-style:normal;" id="mwN7s">Drapeaux, armoiries, symboles et emblèmes de la ville de Paris</cite></a><span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwN7w"> </span>», sur <span class="italique" id="mwN70">svowebmaster.free.fr</span>, Société Vexillologique de l'Ouest</span>.</span></li>
</ol>
